1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Rain unsettles my day.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Patch one spot, another drips.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
You brought a little answer.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
What falls can be a gift.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Turn it to catch the sky.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Old things find new directions.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The first drop finds a home.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
A trouble can nourish.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
A little hope lifts its head.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Catch rain for tomorrow's green.
